==Notes==
* Death Stroke is the cheapest of all the {{ESO Ultimate Link}} abilities, especially when the Soul Harvest morph is chosen, because you earn some back for every kill.
* While under any effect that raises Ultimate costs, Incapacitating Strike will be unusable between 120 Ultimate and the adjusted cost of the improved version that stuns the target. For example, the stunning version costs 123 Ultimate for a stage 1 [[Online:Vampire|Vampire]], and neither version of the skill will be usable between 120 and 122 Ultimate. The icon will still change color at 120.
* As with all other "While slotted on either ability bar" skills, this doesn't work if you have [[ON:Oakensoul Ring|Oakensoul Ring]] and have this skill in the disabled ability bar.
* Before Update 41, Incapacitating Strike had a slotted effect called Reave which restored {{ESO Magicka Link|100}} and {{ESO Stamina Link|100}} every Light and Heavy Attack.
* Soul Harvest is a recommended morph for the [[ON:Nightblade Initiate|Nightblade Initiate]] build, while Incapacitating Strike is recommended for [[ON:Umbral Assassin|Umbral Assassin]].
