==Patch Notes==
{{ESO Patch Note|1.6.5|* This passive now provides the buffs Major Resolve and Major Spell Resist for 4 seconds after using a Shadow ability, with the duration increased when wearing heavy armor.}}
{{ESO Patch Note|3.0.5|* Increased this passive ability's base duration of Major Ward and Major Resolve to 3/6 seconds from 2/4 seconds.
