{{ESO Patch Note|2.3.5|* Adjusted the snare applied to the enemy target at the beginning of all charge/teleport abilities (such as [[ON:Shield Charge|Shield Charge]], [[ON:Critical Charge|Critical Charge]], or Teleport Strike) to be a 60% snare for 750 milliseconds from a 100% snare for 500 milliseconds.
