{{ESO Patch Note|2.3.5|* The Spawn Broodlings and Arachnophobia synergies from this ability and the Tangling Webs morph have had their summoned spider's damage reduced by 44%. The Black Widows synergy from the Shadow Silk morph has had its summoned spider's damage reduced by 35%.}}
{{ESO Patch Note|2.4.5|* Redesigned this ability and its morphs so they are now ground-placed area of effect abilities which create webs at the targeted location for 5 seconds, reducing the Movement Speed of enemies within by 50%. When the webs expire they burst into venom, dealing Poison Damage to enemies within.
