{{ESO Patch Note|5.3.4|* Fixed an issue where this ability and its morphs were being considered Damage over Time instead of melee damage in some cases.}}
{{ESO Patch Note|6.2.5|* Fixed numerous visual issues with this ability and its morphs.}}

